Send_CcipAdapter_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when amount zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when amount non zero
   ├── when route not allowed
   │  └── it should revert with RouteNotAllowed
   └── when route allowed
      ├── when quoted fee exceeds maxFee
      │  └── it should revert with FeeExceedsMax
      └── when quoted fee within maxFee
         ├── given native fee
         │  ├── when msg value below fee
         │  │  └── it should revert with IncorrectNativeFee
         │  └── when msg value at least fee
         │     ├── it should pull amount from the vault
         │     ├── it should reset router allowance to zero
         │     ├── it should emit AdapterAction
         │     └── it should return the messageId
         └── given token fee
            ├── it should pull amount and fee from the vault
            ├── it should reset router allowance for token and feeToken to zero
            └── it should return the messageId
